// FIXTURE, not a gold set. Eight cases whose only job is to exercise the
// harness and show the file format. It is deliberately too small and too easy
// to measure anything: a real set needs enough spread that a weak and a strong
// system score visibly differently, and enough negatives that a system which
// answers everything confidently cannot score well.
//
// Lines starting with // are ignored, so a corpus can carry its own reasoning.
